  "description": "Precision crafted excellence, the Yukon V2 is the next generation eBike continuing the Yukon lineup. Stand out from the crowd with a custom engineered frame featuring integrated long range battery. Offers extreme torque, towing capacity and hill-climbing power with unimaginable synergy of features.\nThese fat-tired workhorses looks great with the integrated battery, giving it a more refined look. Don’t let it’s good looks fool you. It’s our king of the off-road eBikes, and is a great choice for those looking to go off-road and onto loose surfaces such as gravel, sand and snow.\nThe Yukon V2’s wide 26x4” tire is a favourite of our customers who want power, and the ability to go just about everywhere with their bike. It’s got the most powerful rear-hub motor we offer, the G06 by Bafang. This motor is well known for its reliability and low-maintenance.",
